                  <p>
                    REMEMBER TO SET PAYMENT METHODS &amp; OPTIONS OTHERWISE USERS CAN'T MAKE PAYMENT AND FOR THAT REASON PUBLIC REGISTRATION WON'T GO THROUGH.
                    <a href="/account/settings?section=billing" class="btn-primary" style="width:fit-content; display:inline-flex;">Update Payment Method</a>
                  </p>
